      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "Analysis of RW-114 movements on 14 October 2026: Opening stock 52 rolls. Dispatches: ORD-7781 -8, ORD-7784 -5, ORD-7790 -6, ORD-7792 -4 (total -23). Receipts: GRN-3301 +6, GRN-3303 +5, GRN-3304 +6 (total +17). ORD-7788 dispatched -7 but cancelled 10:02 with reversal, net zero. Net change: +17 -23 = -6, closing stock 52-6=46 matches system record. Dispatched units (23) > received units (17). Claim \"Riverside dispatched more units of RW-114 than it received on 14 October\" is supported.",
          "content_hash": "0xe1dfa145445d85004becf29f6ec7e486320d4ad355f3fbbe0ea524a9f24a84b6",
          "created_at_ms": 1793289511708,
