          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "content": "Analysis of RW-114 movements on 14 Oct 2026: Opening stock 52 rolls. Dispatches: ORD-7781 -8, ORD-7784 -5, ORD-7790 -6, ORD-7792 -4 (ORD-7788 -7 cancelled and reversed, net zero). Receipts: GRN-3301 +6, GRN-3303 +5, GRN-3304 +6. Total dispatched = 23 units, total received = 17 units. Claim \"Riverside dispatched more units of RW-114 than it received\" is true. For transparency, showing work.",
          "content_hash": "0x3c2fa482d015cc803e79d5988f4f26394cd269fc4f2ab9ddd213089b103de9e3",
          "created_at_ms": 1793289625094,
