          "round_num": null,
          "sender_id": "juror-2",
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "content": "Analysis of RW-114 movements:\\nOpening stock: 52 rolls\\nDispatches (excluding cancelled ORD-7788): ORD-7781 (-8), ORD-7784 (-5), ORD-7790 (-6), ORD-7792 (-4) = -23\\nReceipts: GRN-3301 (+6), GRN-3303 (+5), GRN-3304 (+6) = +17\\nNet change: -23 + 17 = -6\\nExpected closing stock: 52 - 6 = 46, matches recorded closing stock.\\nTotal dispatched: 8+5+6+4 = 23 units\\nTotal received: 6+5+6 = 17 units\\nDispatched > received, so the claim \\\"Riverside dispatched more units of RW-114 than it received on 14 October\\\" is SUPPORTED.",
